# Line-ending policy
# ------------------
# Normalize all text files to LF, both in the repository and in the working
# tree. Without this, a Windows editor saving CRLF makes every file appear
# modified even when nothing changed, which buries real diffs in noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Text formats that should stay LF explicitly
*.md      text eol=lf
*.mdx     text eol=lf
*.js      text eol=lf
*.jsx     text eol=lf
*.ts      text eol=lf
*.tsx     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.css     text eol=lf
*.html    text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
*.xml     text eol=lf
*.svg     text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf

# Binary assets — git must never rewrite these
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.ico     binary
*.webp    binary
*.woff    binary
*.woff2   binary
*.ttf     binary
*.eot     binary
*.pdf     binary
*.zip     binary
